 "faqs": [
  {
   "q": "Where is DHA Multan?",
   "a": "DHA Multan lies between Bosan Road and Mattital Road, near Bahauddin Zakariya University (BZU). Rumanza is in the north, DHA Villas near the Bosan Road entrance on Jinnah Avenue, and the Southern Business District along the boulevard to the MPS Road gate."
  },
  {
   "q": "What is in the Southern Business District?",
   "a": "SBD Phase I runs along the 300 ft boulevard from the roundabout to the MPS Road gate, with Downtown SBD and commercial Blocks A to L, an arcade, reserved event halls and The Oasis."
  },
  {
   "q": "How many villas are in DHA Villas Multan?",
   "a": "DHA Multan's plan shows 227 villas of 6 marla, 158 of 9 marla and 172 of 12 marla (two designs), around a 3-acre park with a mosque and a shopping arcade."
